cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these estimates, data or code, please cite them as below."
title: "France Economic Pulse: an open nowcast of French industrial production"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "NGUYEN"
    given-names: "Ngoc Minh"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nnm-psd/france_economic_pulse"
url: "https://nnm-psd.github.io/france_economic_pulse/"
abstract: >-
  A daily-updated, bilingual (French/English) nowcast of French industrial production,
  published before INSEE's official release. A ridge regression combines weather-corrected
  electricity consumption (RTE), INSEE business surveys, BODACC insolvency openings and the
  France-Germany 10-year yield spread (ECB). Formulas, live coefficients, a walk-forward
  backtest, a real-time track record and all code and data are public.
keywords:
  - nowcasting
  - industrial production
  - France
  - open data
  - ridge regression
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-03"
